    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive at an industrial complex plagued by a mysterious disaster, but suddenly find your stature reduced several times over. Now every step hides danger. The unknown spawns of the factory are swarming around - mutated creatures eager to tear apart whoever dares to enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the new reality and try to survive in this nightmarish world. Your every move can decide your fate, and fear and uncertainty will be your constant companions. Will you be able to survive long enough or will you become another victim of the dying factory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic graphics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gloomy atmosphere </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different weapons</p>",
